      <slug></slug>
      <title>Ganeti 2.4 and beyond: new challenges in virtualization at the cluster level</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>New challenges in Virtualization devroom</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Ganeti is a cluster virtualization tool developed at Google. The talk will introduce its basics, and have a look at the future challenges and directions it&amp;#39;s taking, both from the original team and the community which has formed around it, with a look towards integration and future development in coexistance with the movements in the virtualization ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
